{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor", "label": "BrokerActor (abstrakte Basisklasse)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jeder Protokoll-Actor erbt den gemeinsamen Lifecycle, damit Subklassen nur drei protokollspezifische Hooks besitzen statt Reconnect, Pufferung und Fan-out je neu zu bauen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_lifecycle_zustandsautomat", "label": "Lifecycle-Zustandsautomat (disconnected/connecting/connected/disconnecting)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_connectimplementation", "label": "connectImplementation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_disconnectimplementation", "label": "disconnectImplementation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Idempotenter Kontrakt: wird beim Stoppen UND vor jedem Re-Connect-Versuch gerufen, damit eine Subklasse nie eine neue Verbindung auf den Handles der toten aufbaut; darf nur lebende Handles verwerfen, nie die gewuenschten Subscriptions."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_dispatchoutgoing", "label": "dispatchOutgoing(envelope)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_stop_waehrend_reconnect", "label": "Stop waehrend eines laufenden Reconnect-Versuchs", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reconnect laeuft auf dem System-Scheduler, entkoppelt von der Mailbox; ohne erneute Lebendpruefung beim Verlassen des Handshakes installierte ein erfolgreicher Handshake Handles auf einem beendeten Aktor und ein gescheiterter verband sich endlos weiter, da maxAttempts per Default Infinity ist (#708)."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_outbound_buffer", "label": "Outbound-Buffer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bis outboundBuffer Envelopes (Default 1000) werden bei Trennung gepuffert und beim Reconnect der Reihe nach geleert; bei Ueberlauf faellt immer das aelteste Envelope (FIFO) und es wird nie geworfen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_enqueueoutbound", "label": "enqueueOutbound(payload)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_subscriber_tracking", "label": "Subscriber-Tracking (subscribeRef / unsubscribeRef / fanOutToTopic)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "unsubscribeRef vergleicht ueber den Pfad der Ref statt ueber das Ref-Objekt, damit eine andere Ref auf denselben Actor trotzdem unsubscribed."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_terminated_arm", "label": "Der Terminated-Arm ist nicht optional", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "onReceive ist abstrakt, die Basis sieht also nie eine Nachricht und kann nicht selbst auf Terminated reagieren; ohne den Arm bleibt ein gestoppter Subscriber in jedem Topic (#1111) und .exhaustive() wirft, was der Standard-Supervisor mit einem vollen Broker-Reconnect beantwortet. Die Weitung des Match-Inputs auf MyCommand | Terminated macht das Weglassen zum Build-Fehler."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_prunetermsubscriber", "label": "pruneTerminatedSubscriber(ref)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Entfernt den Subscriber aus allen Topics und meldet zurueck, ob etwas entfernt wurde; macht bewusst kein unwatch, weil die Zelle die Watch beim Zustellen von Terminated bereits fallen gelassen hat."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_death_watch_nur_lokal", "label": "Death-Watch feuert nur fuer einen lokalen Subscriber", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "context.watch registriert nur fuer eine LocalActorRef und ist sonst ein stiller No-op, ein entfernter Subscriber erzeugt also nie ein Terminated und bleibt bis zum Stop des Broker-Aktors in jedem Topic (#918)."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_desired_subscriptions", "label": "Gewuenschte Subscriptions (Desired Subscriptions)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Die Menge wird getrennt von den lebenden Handles gehalten, damit sie jede einzelne Verbindung ueberlebt; das Wiedereinspielen treibt die Subklasse, weil der richtige Punkt im Handshake protokollspezifisch ist (kafkajs will jedes subscribe vor consumer.run)."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_remembersubscription", "label": "rememberSubscription(key, payload)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein erneutes remember auf einem lebenden Key baut ihn zuerst ab, damit eine geaenderte Nutzlast (etwa ein anderer Ziel-Actor) tatsaechlich greift."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_forgetsubscription", "label": "forgetSubscription(key)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_applysubscription", "label": "applySubscription(key, subscription)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Muss einen bereits lebenden Key tolerieren; eine Subscription, die nicht gesetzt werden kann, wird als Warnung geloggt und der Rest der Menge geht trotzdem durch."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_initialsubscriptions", "label": "initialSubscriptions()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nur einmalig vor dem ersten Connect uebernommen, damit ein unsubscribe zur Laufzeit nicht vom naechsten Reconnect wiederbelebt wird."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_revokesubscription", "label": "revokeSubscription(key)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Optional, weil mehrere Protokolle eine einzelne Subscription nur mitsamt dem ganzen Consumer aufgeben koennen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_reconnect_backoff", "label": "Reconnect mit exponentiellem Backoff", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "min(initialDelayMs * factor^(attempt-1), maxDelayMs), multipliziert mit 1 +/- randomFactor; maxAttempts ist per Default Infinity, reconnect: false schaltet ihn ab."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_jitter_randomfactor", "label": "randomFactor-Jitter", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ohne Jitter ist die Verzoegerung eine reine Funktion von Versuchszaehler und Optionen, jeder Broker-Actor derselben Flotte wacht also in derselben Millisekunde auf und die Herde kann den sich erholenden Broker unten halten; randomFactor: 0 stellt den deterministischen Zeitplan wieder her."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_circuit_breaker_jitter", "label": "Einseitiger Circuit-Breaker-Jitter", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein offener Breaker prueft irgendwo in [resetMs, resetMs x (1 + randomFactor)] erneut - einseitig, damit nie zu frueh erneut versucht wird."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_lifecycle_events", "label": "Broker-Lifecycle-Events auf system.eventStream", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "BrokerConnected, BrokerDisconnected, BrokerReconnectAttempt, BrokerReconnectFailed, BrokerBufferOverflow, BrokerNotConnected; jedes traegt actorPath, damit ein Monitor Events verschiedener Broker-Actors unterscheiden kann."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_settings_aufloesung", "label": "Aufl\u00f6sung der Broker-Settings in drei Ebenen", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "builtInDefaultOptions < readOptionsFromConfig (HOCON) < Konstruktor-Argument; preStart mergt, validiert gegen requiredOptions und wirft frueh, sodass der Actor den Fehlerpfad des Supervisors durchlaeuft, bevor er sich zu verbinden versucht."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_endpointlabel", "label": "endpointLabel()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Menschenlesbare Verbindungs-Identitaet fuer Log-Zeilen und Lifecycle-Events."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_mqttactor_eigene_registry", "label": "MqttActor behaelt seine eigene Subscription-Registry", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Aelter als der Desired-Subscription-Mechanismus und reichhaltiger (QoS pro Topic, mehrere Targets pro Pattern, Deathwatch auf jedem) - mit den gleichen Reconnect-Garantien."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_lifecycle_zustandsautomat", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_outbound_buffer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_reconnect_backoff", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_subscriber_tracking", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_desired_subscriptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/broker-actor-base.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source":